description:
Add Google Analytics UTM parameters (utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign, utm_id, utm_term, utm_content) to a landing page URL. Keeps existing query parameters and the #fragment, lowercases values by default, and predicts the GA4 default channel group.

Returns: JSON { url, params, predictedChannel, warnings[] }: the tagged URL, the UTM values used, the likely GA4 default channel group (approximation) and any naming warnings.
Example input: {"url":"https://example.com/pricing?plan=pro","source":"newsletter","medium":"email","campaign":"October Launch","content":"hero_button"}
